      "widgets_values": [
        "Multi Stitch Images — grid from an IMAGE batch\n\nThree Load Image nodes (ComfyUI's bundled example.png) are joined with Batch Images and fed into the images input, so this runs as-is. The node lays the batch out as a 2-column grid with an 8 px black gap, caps the long side at 1024 px, and output_cells fills the cells output with each image centred in a uniform cell.\n\nImages pasted onto the node come first; the batch frames follow. Replace example.png with your own files or swap the batch for a generated result."
